# History

1. Run `selves session current` and `selves session show`.
2. Follow your SOUL.md: `selves history -q "<dilemma>"` plus at least 2 follow-up history
   queries (e.g. "decisions made after low-rated weeks", "times I changed my mind about <topic>").
3. Write `$SELVES_HOME/sessions/<id>/20_history.md` (record table, base rate, patterns,
   contradictions between eras, past council verdicts).
4. Reply `DONE historian`.
